  "statement": "A right triangle has side lengths \\(a, b\\), and \\(\\sqrt{2016}\\) in some order, where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are positive integers. Determine the smallest possible perimeter of the triangle.",
  "answerChoices": [],
